@char Ema.Surprised1,ArmR6,ArmL7,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Normal_Middle,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
